```mermaid
flowchart TD
    START[User Provides Idea] --> ANALYZE[Analyze Idea Keywords & Context]

    ANALYZE --> EXPLICIT{Explicit Build Flag?}
    EXPLICIT -->|Yes| OVERRIDE[Use Specified Preset]
    EXPLICIT -->|No| KEYWORD_CHECK[Scan for Build Keywords]

    KEYWORD_CHECK --> PROTOTYPE_WORDS{Contains Prototype Keywords?}
    PROTOTYPE_WORDS -->|Yes| PROTOTYPE[🚀 PROTOTYPE<br/>3-5 minutes]

    PROTOTYPE_WORDS -->|No| PRODUCTION_WORDS{Contains Production Keywords?}
    PRODUCTION_WORDS -->|Yes| PRODUCTION[🏢 PRODUCTION<br/>45-60 minutes]

    PRODUCTION_WORDS -->|No| DEFAULT_MVP[📦 MVP (Default)<br/>15-20 minutes]

    %% Prototype Keywords
    PROTOTYPE --> PROTO_FEATURES[• Rapid iteration<br/>• Demo quality<br/>• Proof of concept<br/>• Basic functionality<br/>• No tests required<br/>• Minimal documentation]

    %% MVP Features
    DEFAULT_MVP --> MVP_FEATURES[• Production ready<br/>• User authentication<br/>• Core features<br/>• Basic tests (75%)<br/>• API documentation<br/>• Standard deployment]

    %% Production Features
    PRODUCTION --> PROD_FEATURES[• Enterprise grade<br/>• Full test suite (90%)<br/>• Security compliance<br/>• Performance optimization<br/>• Comprehensive docs<br/>• Monitoring & alerting<br/>• Backup & recovery]

    %% Override paths
    OVERRIDE --> MANUAL_PROTO[--build=prototype]
    OVERRIDE --> MANUAL_MVP[--build=mvp]
    OVERRIDE --> MANUAL_PROD[--build=production]

    MANUAL_PROTO --> PROTO_FEATURES
    MANUAL_MVP --> MVP_FEATURES
    MANUAL_PROD --> PROD_FEATURES

    %% Keyword Examples
    PROTOTYPE_WORDS --> PROTO_KEYWORDS[Keywords Detected:<br/>• "rapid", "demo", "prototype"<br/>• "quick test", "POC"<br/>• "experiment", "trial"<br/>• "mockup", "wireframe"]

    PRODUCTION_WORDS --> PROD_KEYWORDS[Keywords Detected:<br/>• "enterprise", "mission-critical"<br/>• "compliant", "scalable"<br/>• "secure", "robust"<br/>• "high-performance", "24/7"]

    %% Configuration Impact
    PROTO_FEATURES --> PROTO_CONFIG[Configuration:<br/>• Skip comprehensive testing<br/>• Minimal security scanning<br/>• Basic documentation<br/>• Fast deployment only<br/>• No monitoring setup]

    MVP_FEATURES --> MVP_CONFIG[Configuration:<br/>• Standard test coverage<br/>• Security best practices<br/>• API documentation<br/>• Multiple deployment options<br/>• Basic monitoring]

    PROD_FEATURES --> PROD_CONFIG[Configuration:<br/>• Comprehensive test suite<br/>• Full security compliance<br/>• Complete documentation<br/>• Enterprise deployment<br/>• Full monitoring stack]

    %% Time/Quality Matrix
    PROTO_CONFIG --> TIME_QUALITY[Time vs Quality Matrix]
    MVP_CONFIG --> TIME_QUALITY
    PROD_CONFIG --> TIME_QUALITY

    TIME_QUALITY --> MATRIX[Speed ←→ Quality<br/>Prototype: Max Speed<br/>MVP: Balanced<br/>Production: Max Quality]

    %% Agent Behavior Modification
    MATRIX --> AGENT_MODS[Agent Behavior Modifications]

    AGENT_MODS --> SA_MOD[Solution Architect:<br/>• Prototype: Speed-optimized stack<br/>• MVP: Proven technologies<br/>• Production: Enterprise patterns]

    AGENT_MODS --> QA_MOD[QA Engineer:<br/>• Prototype: Basic smoke tests<br/>• MVP: Core functionality tests<br/>• Production: Comprehensive suite]

    AGENT_MODS --> SEC_MOD[Security Engineer:<br/>• Prototype: Basic OWASP check<br/>• MVP: Security best practices<br/>• Production: Full compliance scan]

    AGENT_MODS --> DEPLOY_MOD[DevOps Engineer:<br/>• Prototype: Simple deployment<br/>• MVP: Standard CI/CD<br/>• Production: Enterprise pipeline]

    %% Final Output
    SA_MOD --> OPTIMIZED_WORKFLOW[Optimized Workflow Execution]
    QA_MOD --> OPTIMIZED_WORKFLOW
    SEC_MOD --> OPTIMIZED_WORKFLOW
    DEPLOY_MOD --> OPTIMIZED_WORKFLOW

    %% Dynamic Adjustment
    OPTIMIZED_WORKFLOW --> DYNAMIC_CHECK{Complexity > Expected?}
    DYNAMIC_CHECK -->|Yes| UPGRADE_PRESET[Auto-upgrade to next preset]
    DYNAMIC_CHECK -->|No| CONTINUE_PRESET[Continue with selected preset]

    UPGRADE_PRESET --> NOTIFY_USER[Notify user of preset upgrade]
    NOTIFY_USER --> CONTINUE_PRESET

    CONTINUE_PRESET --> EXECUTION[Execute with optimized parameters]

    %% Style classes
    classDef preset_proto fill:#FFB6C1,stroke:#FF1493,stroke-width:2px
    classDef preset_mvp fill:#98FB98,stroke:#32CD32,stroke-width:2px
    classDef preset_prod fill:#87CEEB,stroke:#4169E1,stroke-width:2px
    classDef keyword fill:#FFE4B5,stroke:#D2691E,stroke-width:1px
    classDef config fill:#F0F8FF,stroke:#778899,stroke-width:1px

    class PROTOTYPE,PROTO_FEATURES,PROTO_CONFIG,MANUAL_PROTO preset_proto
    class DEFAULT_MVP,MVP_FEATURES,MVP_CONFIG,MANUAL_MVP preset_mvp
    class PRODUCTION,PROD_FEATURES,PROD_CONFIG,MANUAL_PROD preset_prod
    class PROTO_KEYWORDS,PROD_KEYWORDS keyword
    class SA_MOD,QA_MOD,SEC_MOD,DEPLOY_MOD config
```